                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6568dd12-d195-3822-a77a-c66b15c3bac2",
                        "entry_id": "ef02c37e-962c-32f9-8743-82350754ff09",
                        "glosses": [
                            "to find fault with, to carp on, to nag, to pick on (to criticize excessively)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d70c07d3-e4b7-4287-a896-1f4a7268374b",
                                "sense_id": "6568dd12-d195-3822-a77a-c66b15c3bac2",
                                "text": "Не придраться ли нам к Муссолини и всем (Воровскому и всему составу делегации) уехать из Италии, начав травлю её за фашистов?\n[...]\nПо-моему, следует.",
                                "translation": "Perhaps we should tear at Mussolini and have everyone (Vorovsky and the whole delegation) leave Italy, starting to attack her over her fascists?\n…\nI think we should do this.",
                                "english": "Perhaps we should tear at Mussolini and have everyone (Vorovsky and the whole delegation) leave Italy, starting to attack her over her fascists?\n…\nI think we should do this."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
